        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Why do you have to use Yunobo's sword to beat a Stone Pebblit?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:41:15+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Some weapons are for cutting, and others are for smashing.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:41:16+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Think of a hammer and a kitchen knife. You can't use a hammer to chop vegetables!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:41:18+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Then that would be “hammering vegetables.”",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:41:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I used to avoid Stone Pebblits whenever I saw them because none of my weapons worked.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:41:22+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Later, I saw you pick one up and smash it to death.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T17:21:18+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "zh-CN-mandarin",
      "code": "zh-CN",
      "language": "汉语",
      "variant": "普通话",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "锤菜",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "小岩石巨人为什么要用阿沅的刀才能打？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "有些刀是用来切的，有的刀是用来砸的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就像锤子和菜刀，你总不能用锤子来切菜吧！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这就是“锤菜”了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "以前我遇到小岩石巨人都是躲着走的，因为我的武器都打不了它。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "后面才看到你把它举起来砸死。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
      "code": "es-ES",
      "language": "西班牙语",
      "variant": "西班牙本土西语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Machacar verduras con un martillo",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_title_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:08+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Por qué hay que usar el arma de Yunobo para derrotar a un litorok?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:10+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Algunas armas sirven para cortar y otras para golpear.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:12+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Es como un martillo y un cuchillo de cocina. ¡No puedes cortar verduras con un martillo!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:15+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Entonces sería «machacar verduras con un martillo».",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:16+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Antes evitaba a los litoroks porque ninguna de mis armas funcionaba contra ellos.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Luego te vi levantar uno y matarlo estrellándolo contra el suelo.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:07:20+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Marteler des légumes",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:06+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Pourquoi faut-il utiliser l'arme de Yunobo pour vaincre un Tilhorok ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:08+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Certaines armes servent à couper, et d'autres à frapper.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:10+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "C'est comme un marteau et un couteau de cuisine. Tu ne peux quand même pas couper des légumes avec un marteau !",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:13+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Alors, ce serait « marteler des légumes ».",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:15+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Avant, j'évitais toujours les Tilhoroks, car aucune de mes armes ne fonctionnait contre eux.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:18+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Puis je t'ai vu en soulever un et le tuer en le jetant au sol.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:46:20+08:00",
